# Normally generated by: python tools/sub2nodes.py   (uses SUB_URL from config/flint.env)
# One node per line: code  address  sni  pbk  sid  [uuid]  [port]
# The comment line right above a node is its name in the web panel.
# Values come from the vless:// link: vless://UUID@ADDRESS:PORT?sni=SNI&pbk=PBK&sid=SID#NAME
# uuid defaults to VLESS_UUID from flint.env, port defaults to 443.
# 🚀 Auto
auto  auto.example.net  www.example.com  PUBLIC_KEY_43_CHARS_BASE64URL_xxxxxxxxxxxx  0123456789abcdef
# 🇳🇱 Netherlands
nl    nl-1.example.net  www.example.com  PUBLIC_KEY_43_CHARS_BASE64URL_xxxxxxxxxxxx  0123456789abcdef
